Third-party components
----------------------

Building this firmware requires libDaisy (https://github.com/electro-smith/libDaisy,
MIT License, Copyright (c) Electrosmith; it includes the STM32 HAL and ST USB
middleware) and the Alchemy SDK (https://github.com/hermetic-modular/alchemy-sdk).
Both are git submodules under lib/ and are not redistributed here.

alchemy/src/LICENSE-ST-USB.md is STMicroelectronics' license (SLA0044) for the
ST USB middleware the firmware is built against.

Hermetic Modular and Alchemy Lab are names of Hermetic Modular. This project is
not made, tested or supported by Hermetic Modular.
